# Semantics that must be the same in every target language (docs/core.md, "What a value means").

Test "division is exact, never cut to a whole number":
  Expect 7 / 2 to be 3.5
  Expect 1 / 4 to be 0.25

Test "decimals are exact":
  Expect 0.10 + 0.20 to be 0.3

Test "rounding goes half away from zero":
  Expect round 2.5 to be 3
  Expect round -2.5 to be -3
  Expect round 2.675 to 2 places to be 2.68

Test "remainder has the sign of the divisor":
  Expect 7 mod 3 to be 1
  Expect -7 mod 3 to be 2

Test "positions start at 1":
  Set letters to ["a", "b", "c"]
  Expect letters at 1 to be "a"
  Expect letters at 3 to be "c"

Test "nothing is its own value":
  Set note to nothing
  Expect note to be nothing

Test "dividing by zero fails with a clear message":
  Expect 1 / 0 to fail with "divided by zero"
